        {
          "id": 1299834770,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Do we use `pidl` or `idl2ws` ? Looks like these dissectors are generated using `pidl` but i don't see any option to pass .cnf to pidl. \n\nWhen i tried it with idl2ws, i got some parsing errors. I think `idl2ws` does not understand `MANUAL`. Need some pointers on how to do that.\n\nidl2wrs with some additional logging:\n```\nidl2wrs srvsvc\n\nERROR: could not parse cnf directive:MANUAL srvsvc_dissect_element_NetShareInfo_info1501_\n```",
