          "body": "@alagoutte I worked on fixing the srvsvc.idl/cnf. Do you want me to put another merge request with that?\nSo that we can decide whether to go ahead with this MR or the new one ?\n\nI used the new IDL and generated the code using PIDL and fixed other related stuff. Should we try that ?\nThe newly code can compile and it works fine without any issue but my tests are with smaller set of pcaps. \nShould we put that in CI and give a try ?\n\nIf you want to try the new idl/cnf, do you want me to commit the generated code or can i expect CI to generate that ?",
